Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:51:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] DUB BASE v1.3: AUX = 1 V/oct pitch CV of the chord root,
 CV TUNE

AUX now holds the root note of each chord (C3 = 0 V). Both buttons 2 s
enter CV TUNE (AUX alternates 0 V / +2 V, FREQUENCY trims the scale,
tap saves it with the calibration data); 4 s = CV input calibration.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0136WGYBVJqXHJBPS2niCsJ8
